[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:10.68]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:15.34]left a single note and went on their way
[00:20.92]I never got their name until the credits
[00:24.48]now it plays here every single day
[00:29.04]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:31.72]One note at a time
[00:38.94]from people passing through
[00:41.80]a name beside a line
[00:47.88]and part of it is you
[00:53.38]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
